   "display_name": "Horned Fire Ball",
   "unlock_upgrade": 0,
   "description": "Every 20 seconds:\n- This unit's next attack applies a DemonHead radius on an enemy for 10 seconds\nEnemies inside DemonHead's radius:\n- Take 10% increased damage from this unit\nDemonHead:\n- When this unit attacks an enemy inside its radius, apply 1 instance of EnhancedBurn\n- EnhancedBurn deals 75% damage in 4 ticks over 4 seconds\n- Stores all EnhancedBurn damage dealt while active"
  },
  {
   "name": "ShinraPassive2",
   "display_name": "Horns Fire Charge",
