   "description": "This unit has DemonMeter, starting at 0. (Capacity: 20)\nWhile an enemy is affected by DemonHead:\n- Gain 1 DemonMeter every second\nFor each DemonMeter:\n- Decrease SPA by 1%\n- Increase Attack Speed by 1%"
  },
  {
   "name": "ShinraPassive3",
   "display_name": "Horned Fire Bite",
